{"video":"6CrHSo_Sod8","lines":[{"t":[0,1.1],"en":"I'm so excited."},{"t":[1.2,3.3],"en":"I just set Rachel up with the worst guy tonight."},{"t":[3.5,4.5],"en":"All right. Who is he?"},{"t":[4.9,6.6],"en":"Well, it's this guy I used to massage."},{"t":[6.7,8.4],"en":"And by massage, I mean hold down"},{"t":[8.4,9.9],"en":"so he wouldn't turn over and flash me."},{"t":[11.8,12.4],"en":"Okay, okay."},{"t":[12.8,14.7],"en":"Wait till you hear who I got for Ross."},{"t":[14.7,15.1],"en":"Oh, yeah."},{"t":[16.2,18.3],"en":"She's this really boring woman."},{"t":[18.5,19.3],"en":"She's a teacher."},{"t":[21.6,22.3],"en":"A teacher?"},{"t":[22.6,24.5],"en":"Yeah, yeah. She's really into history"},{"t":[24.5,25.6],"en":"and foreign movies."},{"t":[25.8,27.6],"en":"Oh, oh. And she loves puzzles."},{"t":[27.9,28.2],"en":"Huh?"},{"t":[29.1,30.6],"en":"Come on. Who loves puzzles?"},{"t":[31.6,33],"en":"Well, Ross does."},{"t":[34.8,36.4],"en":"You're ruining the plan."},{"t":[37.3,39.8],"en":"Joey, you fixed him up with his perfect woman."},{"t":[40.4,41.5],"en":"Oh, my God. You're right."},{"t":[41.5,43.8],"en":"She even reads for pleasure."}]}
